#: ../../library/imu.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`imu` --- IMU helper for the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense"
msgstr ":mod:`imu` --- helper IMU untuk Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:10
msgid ""
"This page documents the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense's Python ``imu`` module (a"
" small wrapper around the on-board IMU drivers). For the OpenMV C-level "
"``imu`` module that ships on the OPENMV_N6, OPENMV_RT1060, and OPENMV_AE3 "
"camera boards, see :doc:`omv.imu`."
msgstr ""
"Halaman ini mendokumentasikan modul Python ``imu`` pada Arduino Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense (pembungkus tipis di atas driver IMU on-board). Untuk modul ``imu`` "
"level-C OpenMV yang dikirimkan pada papan kamera OPENMV_N6, OPENMV_RT1060, "
"dan OPENMV_AE3, lihat :doc:`omv.imu`\\ ."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:15
msgid ""
"This module is a thin board-specific wrapper that exposes the on-board "
"inertial measurement unit of the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense as a single "
":py:class:`~imu.IMU` object. Both hardware revisions of the board are "
"handled transparently:"
msgstr ""
"Modul ini adalah pembungkus tipis yang spesifik papan yang mengekspos unit "
"pengukuran inersia on-board pada Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense sebagai satu "
"objek :py:class:`~imu.IMU`\\ . Kedua revisi hardware papan ditangani secara "
"transparan:"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:20
msgid "**Rev 1** uses a single LSM9DS1 9-axis IMU."
msgstr "**Rev 1** menggunakan IMU 9-sumbu LSM9DS1 tunggal."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Rev 2** combines a Bosch BMI270 (accelerometer + gyroscope) with a Bosch "
"BMM150 magnetometer."
msgstr ""
"**Rev 2** menggabungkan Bosch BMI270 (akselerometer + giroskop) dengan "
"magnetometer Bosch BMM150."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:24
msgid ""
"The constructor probes the I2C bus for the BMI270 address (``0x68``) and "
"selects the matching driver automatically, so user code can be written once "
"and run on either revision."
msgstr ""
"Konstruktor memeriksa bus I2C untuk alamat BMI270 (\\ ``0x68``\\ ) dan "
"memilih driver yang sesuai secara otomatis, sehingga kode pengguna dapat "
"ditulis sekali dan dijalankan pada kedua revisi."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:28
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:45
msgid "class IMU"
msgstr "class IMU"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:49
msgid "Construct an IMU object bound to an I2C bus."
msgstr "Buat objek IMU yang terikat pada bus I2C."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:51
msgid ""
"*bus* is an initialised :py:class:`machine.I2C` instance connected to the "
"on-board IMU(s)."
msgstr ""
"*bus* adalah instance :py:class:`machine.I2C` yang telah diinisialisasi dan "
"terhubung ke IMU on-board."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:54
msgid ""
"On construction the bus is scanned: if a device responds at address ``0x68``"
" a `BMI270` plus `BMM150` pair is instantiated (Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev 2), "
"otherwise an `LSM9DS1` is instantiated (Rev 1). The underlying driver is "
"kept on the ``imu`` attribute and configured with default ranges and output "
"data rates."
msgstr ""
"Saat konstruksi, bus dipindai: jika perangkat merespons pada alamat "
"``0x68``\\ , pasangan `BMI270` dan `BMM150` diinstansiasi (Nano 33 BLE Sense"
" Rev 2), jika tidak maka `LSM9DS1` diinstansiasi (Rev 1). Driver yang "
"mendasarinya disimpan pada atribut ``imu`` dan dikonfigurasi dengan rentang "
"dan laju data keluaran default."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:62
msgid ""
"Return the latest accelerometer reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in units "
"of *g* (standard gravities)."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan pembacaan akselerometer terbaru sebagai tuple ``(x, y, z)`` dalam"
" satuan *g* (gravitasi standar)."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:67
msgid ""
"Return the latest gyroscope reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in degrees per"
" second."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan pembacaan giroskop terbaru sebagai tuple ``(x, y, z)`` dalam "
"derajat per detik."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:72
msgid ""
"Return the latest magnetometer reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in micro-"
"tesla (uT)."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan pembacaan magnetometer terbaru sebagai tuple ``(x, y, z)`` dalam "
"micro-tesla (uT)."
